    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "This is a 2-part, proof-of-concept study to be conducted globally, designed to evaluate the safety, tolerability, clinical activity, pharmacokinetics, and pharmacodynamics of BLU-808, a wild type KIT inhibitor, in participants with CIndU (Part A) or CSU (Part B)."
    },
